// CE Restored adaptation dialogue. Travel is free during the location beta.
{1}{I know a few roads that never made it onto the maps. Where would you like to go?}{I know a few roads that never made it onto the maps. Where would you like to go?}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{Take me to Smugglers' Cove.}{}{5}{}{-20}{ }
{3}{Take me back to your camp outside Tarant.}{}{5}{}{-10}{ }
{4}{Take me to the Valley of the Exiles.}{}{5}{}{-40}{ }
{5}{Not now.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{6}{Go cove.}{}{-4}{}{-20}{ }
{7}{Go back to the Tarant camp.}{}{-4}{}{-10}{ }
{8}{Go valley.}{}{-4}{}{-40}{ }
{10}{Back to my camp by the river outside Tarant, then. Stay close.}{Back to my camp by the river outside Tarant, then. Stay close.}{}{}{}{ }
{20}{I'll mark the cove on your map and leave you by the approach. The locals will leave you alone if you do the same. Mind the wildlife, though. I'll wait nearby if you need passage back.}{I'll mark the cove on your map and leave you by the approach. The locals will leave you alone if you do the same. Mind the wildlife, though. I'll wait nearby if you need passage back.}{}{}{}{ }
{30}{Smugglers, warehouses, and a quiet landing. Marek trades supplies near the entrance, and the dockmaster can tell you about the place. Keep your hands off other people's belongings and you should get along. The woods are another matter.}{Smugglers, warehouses, and a quiet landing. Marek trades supplies near the entrance, and the dockmaster can tell you about the place. Keep your hands off other people's belongings and you should get along. The woods are another matter.}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{Let's talk about travelling.}{}{5}{}{1}{ }
{32}{I'll stay here for now.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{9}{Stay here.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{40}{The Valley of the Exiles, then. Stay close. I can bring you back to Tarant when you are ready.}{The Valley of the Exiles, then. Stay close. I can bring you back to Tarant when you are ready.}{}{}{}{ }
